{"id":"wb-6-299","name":"地坛","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"地坛","text":"地坛（满语：ᠨᠠ ‍ᡳᠮᡠᡍᡩᡝᡥᡠᠨ　转写：na i mukdehun）在中国北京安定门外，是明世宗以后明清两代皇帝每年夏至祭祀大地之神（后土皇地祇）的地方，20世纪后逐渐开辟为公园。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%9B","revisionId":92021261,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92021261","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e0d492c53c3c24f474f73676.jpg","title":"地坛公园_1231.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%9B%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD_1231.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c7/%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%9B%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD_1231.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"David290","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"地坛公园拍照","width":320,"height":240}}